{"rule":"lemma-pool/v1","groups":{"comunicar":{"host":"9c7a01c3","siblings":["04926c6a","a45f6473"]}},"rows":{"04926c6a":{"word":"comunicarnos","rank":9397,"meanings":[{"headword":"comunicar","pos":"transitive verb","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:comunicar:229","translation":"to communicate","context":"to relay"},{"headword":"comunicarse","pos":"reciprocal verb","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:comunicarse:16f8","translation":"to communicate","context":"to exchange information"},{"headword":"comunicarse","pos":"reciprocal verb","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:comunicarse:16f86","translation":"to communicate","context":"to understand"},{"headword":"comunicarse","pos":"pronominal verb","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:comunicarse:1bd","translation":"to get in touch with","context":"to reach; used with \"con\""}]},"a45f6473":{"word":"comunícame","rank":9961,"meanings":[{"headword":"comunicar","pos":"transitive verb","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:comunicar:229","translation":"to communicate","context":"to relay"},{"headword":"comunicar","pos":"transitive verb","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:comunicar:c3d","translation":"to put through","context":"telecommunications"},{"headword":"comunicar","pos":"transitive verb","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:comunicar:595","translation":"to get through to","context":"telecommunications"},{"headword":"comunicar","pos":"transitive verb","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:comunicar:87f","translation":"to connect","context":"to join"},{"headword":"comunicar","pos":"intransitive verb","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:comunicar:cb3","translation":"to get through to","context":"to talk on the phone; used with \"con\""}]}},"examples":{"04926c6a":{"m":[[{"t":"Solo necesitamos el aparato para comunicarnos con ellos.","e":"We just need a device to be able to communicate with them.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"ae6e4159ec2f08d5d5cc03ea7aa6901b","i":"5c9f72f3138b2091554932aa0efc2971","r":"5755868:6920174:86:3425859","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5755868","6920174","86"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Antes que nada, necesitamos una forma de comunicarnos.","e":"First, we need a way to communicate.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"f9553d00cca136ef3a0a5ba63ac2f58b","i":"b3c4e3a76fd7790efa160008a71f5399","r":"5197768:6622866:269:1611534","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5197768","6622866","269"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Si nos acercamos al planeta tendremos más probabilidades de comunicarnos.","e":"The closer we get to the planet... the better chance we have to communicate with them.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"90d0bf7bb3ccccf20f0fbe7915c15b82","i":"aea87e6b59d49529d638cf8e81f0de0a","r":"2316204:7058191:886:2914487","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2316204","7058191","886"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Para lograrlo, estamos abiertos a comunicarnos con los captores.","e":"In order to achieve that, we're willing to open up lines of communication with their captors.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"36be14a894d9c6b1ca5e4c0fa09b07cf","i":"aafb67e62eebe6dbc70be1c62e5bc97f","r":"5095742:6541631:366:1454786","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5095742","6541631","366"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Me alegra poder comunicarnos abierta y honestamente.","e":"I'm just happy that we can communicate openly and honestly.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"b6e8bc1cda93eb4ae1c6d6a007a588cc","i":"c07351d0e6aa968318370154f6b1b5f2","r":"1489889:6733770:1134:34660","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["1489889","6733770","1134"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Comunicarnos entre sí, como un equipo.","e":"Communicate with each other, like a team.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"c3d204cf722a26a55bcb1acaebdefba8","i":"d8fba873df04b278772b979dd9071988","r":"4741656:6591515:284:1024445","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4741656","6591515","284"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"En mi experiencia, comunicarnos con nuestros periodistas a menudo... hace que caiga la fruta del árbol.","e":"In my experience, sharing with our journalists often has a way of... Shaking the fruit out of the tree.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"5ca1ce3c2c9320b8f855397704960b2f","i":"41d9641ff4ab141c6bafc9055033aa92","r":"5127430:6586266:113:1486750","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5127430","6586266","113"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Con el fin de reducir los malentendidos deberíamos aprender las técnicas para comunicarnos satisfactoriamente.","e":"To reduce misunderstandings we should learn the techniques for communicating successfully.","s":"tatoeba","x":"979c142864e42354cb19842b6ae21424","i":"bb5105d2341fa71815eaa033576f4b45","r":"1635965:240261","c":"teskmon","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1635965","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1635965","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1635965 by teskmon; English translation #240261 by CM","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1635965","tu":1,"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Para comunicarnos, tienes que decírmelo.","e":"If we're to communicate, you have to tell me.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"6567668d71ee671479195cedb3dcbf69","i":"3a3087583288e419a947c3704a63dba7","r":"4465564:6962315:303:3042079","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4465564","6962315","303"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"¿Van a comunicarnos las coordenadas?","e":"Are they going to communicate the coordinates?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"bef9b5365d0205eff25809467a167962","i":"7122208e63683bdbdeef01708264fed4","r":"6242198:7036295:25:3871127","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6242198","7036295","25"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"¿Una manera para comunicarnos?","e":"A way for us to communicate?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"5a04c88473095c95d58984414c63b407","i":"4bb1ab80e38aa474776836e07618e2f8","r":"6210144:6852803:351:3835656","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6210144","6852803","351"],"w":["leaf",1]}],[{"t":"Creo que podemos usarlo para comunicarnos con él cuando volvamos.","e":"I think we can use it to communicate with him when we get back.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"e46e53c468e212262dad4edb352c6a8f","i":"94d4bb009955792b197d340f217a4782","r":"5584108:6816387:343:2285309","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5584108","6816387","343"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"Sabes que podemos comunicarnos por mensajes de texto, ¿cierto?","e":"You know we can communicate through text, right?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"2e0bbb5dbec9f01b90a2fb721fc0a2df","i":"d16571ec4e87f1e5ddea52ea92e2ed09","r":"5895810:7034300:856:3545400","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5895810","7034300","856"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Usamos tanto gestos como palabras para comunicarnos con los demás.","e":"We use gestures as well as words to communicate with others.","s":"tatoeba","x":"46cb2df8a2a8d855bb7321c13db74ff0","i":"5b787db93526dc1cc8faad50c35388c8","r":"4720115:23256","c":"saverius","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4720115","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4720115","b":"Tatoeba sentence #4720115 by saverius; English translation #23256 by Swift","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4720115","tu":1,"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Vivimos en una época en la que podemos comunicarnos con cada punto del globo.","e":"We live in an age where we can communicate to every point on the globe.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"77b7d599274d642ffdaef99068d70c28","i":"f4bc9111af4aa8f397aaf4c480298a40","r":"6108612:6971392:15:2740647","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6108612","6971392","15"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Fue el que nos ayudó a comunicarnos.","e":"He was the one who helped us communicate.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"36f9c9a02fbbb1262f8d3dc95141f0fc","i":"dc85fa2874573e84e749da2bf9faede0","r":"5847440:6753916:53:2542366","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5847440","6753916","53"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"No creo que volvamos a comunicarnos.","e":"I don't think that we'll be communicating any more.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"3360ab468fcc399008f9aecf12756c13","i":"014dfc07c8916304769329de15e01d0e","r":"5792564:6828833:197:2499543","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5792564","6828833","197"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"Aún no pudimos comunicarnos a nadie.","e":"We still can't reach anyone.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"c7aae322c06a22a745cba1730da3f031","i":"c180f08370e577828779c36166a21ec6","r":"2667380:6896649:300:172557","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2667380","6896649","300"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"¿Podemos comunicarnos, por favor?","e":"Can we be communicating, please?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"d70366b1ae0bb55d3d2ed1b1249d1ace","i":"031c8ae5655af54e81e6d473b2f4efe9","r":"5213824:6483909:405:1653465","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5213824","6483909","405"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"Usamos palabras para comunicarnos.","e":"We use words in order to communicate.","s":"tatoeba","x":"8b247ceeb116d2279b930cc0aa8ba4ca","i":"3cb1fa87ba5e36ae457012fac9742ade","r":"865302:28215","c":"Rafp","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/865302","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/865302","b":"Tatoeba sentence #865302 by Rafp; English translation #28215 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/865302","tu":1,"w":["leaf",1]}],[{"t":"Debemos intentar calmarnos, comunicarnos mejor y asegurarnos de recordar que debemos trabajar juntos.","e":"We have to try and stay a little calmer, communicate better and just make sure that we remember to work together.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"caf0223e738356d49bfe0962e62faefe","i":"ea0e0976be281586c1ec56ca4544f5c3","r":"5482626:6542365:911:2128594","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5482626","6542365","911"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"Solo tenemos descubrir cómo comunicarnos con él.","e":"We just have to figure out how to communicate with him.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"c876419c33cddc86648524d72e01d88b","i":"ed69dadb67f12eb7d21f5b628b92b758","r":"4859594:6850621:242:3089226","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4859594","6850621","242"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"Desde que nació siempre hemos podido comunicarnos. Sabemos lo que el otro piensa, como gemelos.","e":"Ever since he was born, I've always been able to communicate, know what the other one was thinking, like twins.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"5eaf00f43cbff1132e5c57f8199ab275","i":"fcbbb80657c1de5e1948ac82c2dc878a","r":"3991412:6861894:126 127:463136","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3991412","6861894","126 127"],"w":["glosskey",0]},{"t":"Y debemos aprender a comunicarnos.","e":"And we should learn to communicate.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"114cda41fa13409e5a9aad8559685d1a","i":"d916996393dc30bf54dfef9956cc4561","r":"6157350:7035535:549:2784538","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6157350","7035535","549"],"w":["glosskey",0]}],[{"t":"No podemos comunicarnos con Licata, pero trabaja en casa.","e":"We can't get ahold of Licata, but he works from home.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"e7f85582ef8357eeeed8d5e8eb17d981","i":"9f86b9de57d9e8cb4f769f7144ecb29c","r":"6647144:6944490:251:4135432","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6647144","6944490","251"],"w":["tuple",0]}]]},"a45f6473":{"m":[[{"t":"Comunícame con el equipo que tiene a los niños Bowman.","e":"Put me through to the team holding the Bowman children.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"5a8b46c7ac91df309c5021267e5dde3d","i":"6c0cef5ed95d13f3d2de1a0524176ac0","r":"5845764:6912411:403:3497078","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5845764","6912411","403"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Ker-rah, comunícame con la senadora, quiero hacerle una entrevista para nuestra edición principal.","e":"Ker-rah, get me the Senator, I wanna do an interview for our lead story. Ah.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"f45b6ae3363282544f51977351bd90fd","i":"40a8a6dcb256f15d6bc7563da5d2db0c","r":"4955288:6478496:676:1295860","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4955288","6478496","676"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Comunícame con los otros.","e":"Open up the line for me.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"900e9da5eadca0ba122981a6c16c0bfc","i":"920e32084aea52e5f4c409331bb238dd","r":"4467626:6753994:713:729026","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4467626","6753994","713"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Comunícame lo que averigües.","e":"Let me know what you find out.","s":"tatoeba","x":"012b857022462b1aab6163d6b77aa70d","i":"227d8af9298b1b582d02817e9f3e889f","r":"1305425:1140078","c":"marcelostockle","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1305425","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1305425","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1305425 by marcelostockle; English translation #1140078 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1305425","tu":1,"w":["leaf",1]}],[],[{"t":"Comunícame con alguien que esté en el puente.","e":"Get me through to someone on the bridge.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"557a2f8835f63f1fcbef5e77f8aebbba","i":"7aabb647e0db3c41742d035e879050fb","r":"5350150:6908919:505:3183864","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5350150","6908919","505"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Comunícame con el aeropuerto de Pittsburgh, por favor.","e":"Connect me with Pittsburgh airport, please.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"a0a1f5f8cab8d3d043d230f9aa211ee4","i":"b40299c6fe4bf0e7e93840302df51cc7","r":"4581576:7000196:183:3051153","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4581576","7000196","183"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Comunícame con el presidente de Guatemala.","e":"Call the Guatemalan president.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"5086937bf2564da556213bd0b3de5620","i":"3cd60f4b790743c616c656d156b26c97","r":"7028368:7017491:346:4223964","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["7028368","7017491","346"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Comunícame con los de producción.","e":"Get me Production.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"ab3b6a9c8a1c198b7851246f8d